      "start_seconds": 1.19,
      "end_seconds": 6.52,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.59,
      "end_seconds": 12.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.85,
      "text": "not at all, please sit what seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.5,
      "end_seconds": 20.73,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "Well, I've been having breathlessness building over weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.75,
      "end_seconds": 25.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "I'll note down your vital signs first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 38.69,
      "end_seconds": 40.69,
      "duration_seconds": 2.0,
      "text": "sit still for a moment.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 62.04,
      "end_seconds": 71.19,
      "duration_seconds": 9.15,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 96, respiratory rate 21, saturation 90 percent. And temperature is 37.6 degrees, blood pressure 128 over 82."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.43,
      "end_seconds": 90.73,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 92.52,
      "end_seconds": 96.83,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Ah, it's been going on for three days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.24,
      "end_seconds": 98.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.08,
      "text": "Hm, okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.71,
      "end_seconds": 102.39,
      "duration_seconds": 2.68,
      "text": "There's a dry cough as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 103.59,
      "end_seconds": 107.9,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "Okay, did you get leg swelling, night sweats or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 109.74,
      "end_seconds": 112.27,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "no, not a single one"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.24,
      "end_seconds": 115.94,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "any coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.87,
      "end_seconds": 121.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.91,
      "text": "not at all, no coughing up blood"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 122.47,
      "end_seconds": 125.04,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 125.55,
      "end_seconds": 129.11,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "nothing on the skin, uh, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 129.93,
      "end_seconds": 133.78,
      "duration_seconds": 3.85,
      "text": "Any pins and needles or loss of strength anywhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 135.4,
      "end_seconds": 136.83,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Nothing odd there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.35,
      "end_seconds": 146.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Do you follow any particular diet?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 147.99,
      "end_seconds": 151.89,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "I'm vegetarian and have been for years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 157.25,
      "end_seconds": 160.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.41,
      "text": "what do you do during the day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.54,
      "end_seconds": 165.19,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "I look after my grandchildren most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 176.44,
      "end_seconds": 181.33,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 181.89,
      "end_seconds": 185.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.0,
      "end_seconds": 202.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "do you have any long-term conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.71,
      "end_seconds": 205.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.69,
      "text": "I've got eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.53,
      "end_seconds": 211.88,
      "duration_seconds": 5.35,
      "text": "alright, are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 213.09,
      "end_seconds": 217.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.35,
      "text": "Uh, no, I've never reacted to anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.1,
      "end_seconds": 221.22,
      "duration_seconds": 2.12,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 222.26,
      "end_seconds": 223.46,
      "duration_seconds": 1.2,
      "text": "okay, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 225.29,
      "end_seconds": 227.7,
      "duration_seconds": 2.41,
      "text": "I'm just checking this side."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 239.28,
      "end_seconds": 244.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "There is dullness to percussion and reduced breath sounds at the right base."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.28,
      "end_seconds": 260.03,
      "duration_seconds": 12.75,
      "text": "Please sit back down. Right, here's what I'm thinking. My working impression is a pleural effusion needing a cause. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 262.01,
      "end_seconds": 263.96,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "Is it dangerous, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 264.98,
      "end_seconds": 281.37,
      "duration_seconds": 16.39,
      "text": "Nothing I've seen today points to an emergency. It looks like a pleural effusion needing a cause, but I'd like to confirm. I'm sending you for a CT scan of the chest because of pleural effusion."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 282.77,
      "end_seconds": 286.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "I can book that that for Thursday at 10 am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.47,
      "end_seconds": 302.44,
      "duration_seconds": 14.97,
      "text": "let's get a pleural fluid sample, for pleural effusion. I am arranging an urgent chest clinic review. Come back after the scan. Okay, can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 303.8,
      "end_seconds": 309.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "So, I come back after the scan. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.49,
      "end_seconds": 317.01,
      "duration_seconds": 5.52,
      "text": "yes, exactly right. I think we're done unless you have questions"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.85,
      "end_seconds": 320.44,
      "duration_seconds": 1.59,
      "text": "That's clear, thanks."
    }
  ]
